    2. Choose N regions (1-4) that fit non-overlapping with >=1 cell gap
    3. For each region, pick top-left (r,c) so 5x5 bbox fits in grid
    4. Fill entire grid with teal, then stamp each 5x5 bbox as all-black
    5. For each 3x3 interior, randomly set 1-6 positions to teal (ensure >=1 teal and >=2 non-center black remain)
